{"version":1,"content":"<p>年度「加州當代藝術博物館」（LACMA）舉辦的電影與藝術慈善晚宴，昨晚於博物館隆重舉行。</p><p>而一眾來自世界各地的名人紅星均傾巢而出盛裝示人，其中Rose獲邀請於晚宴上兼任表演嘉賓，大唱「洗腦神曲」《APT.》，即時炒熱全場氣氛！</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.693702+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T04:56:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:52.327673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"2c4fcff80d95ab39a6ad83e9d1f172bf5899408621f54b8dc57ec054ef1d9299","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}